Third-party components
----------------------

Online Boutique (microservices-demo)
  Source: https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/microservices-demo
  License: Apache 2.0
  Copyright: Google LLC
  Usage: Evaluation testbed only (Docker images pulled at runtime; not
         redistributed in this repository).

causal-learn
  Source: https://github.com/py-why/causal-learn
  License: MIT
  Copyright: Carnegie Mellon University
  Usage: FCI causal discovery algorithm (installed as a dependency).

The fault scenario datasets in datasets/rift_faults/ are synthetic
benchmarks constructed for this research. They contain no third-party
data and are distributed under the same MIT license as this repository.
